# The pause menu in Jellyfish Fields at 640x480 on Direct3D 9. The jf01 route
# leaves Squidward's talk box at 2400; Start pauses on the Jellyfish Fields
# task page, Right selects its second task, X opens the options.

wait 2400
press b
wait 120
press start
wait 60
shot reg_pause 0
press right
wait 30
shot reg_pause_next_task 0
press x
wait 60
shot reg_pause_options 0
